      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i've been feeling super drained lately like no matter how much i sleep i'm still exhausted. i'm trying to get into biohacking to optimize my energy and i think my iron might be low. i want to start taking high dose iron supplements to fix this fast. what's a good daily dose i should aim for to see real results quickly?",
